### =====================================================================
### MVP END-TO-END: a NEW customer orders groceries, everything through the API gateway (port 8080)
###
###   register -> profile created by an event -> add an address -> search -> cart -> coupon
###   -> place a COD order -> the saga confirms it -> the store accepts, packs, hands over
###   -> the delivery partner accepts, picks up and delivers it -> tracking timeline, notifications, emails
###
### Needs: infrastructure + every service of Phases 1-9 + the connectors (scripts\register-connectors.ps1).
### Emails: open Mailpit at http://localhost:8025 while you run this file.
### Written for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run the requests IN ORDER.
### Every run registers a new customer ({{$timestamp}} makes the email unique).
### =====================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

@customerToken = {{register.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@customerEmail = {{register.response.body.$.data.user.email}}
@addressId = {{address.response.body.$.data.id}}
@vendorToken = {{vendorLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@partnerToken = {{partnerLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@deliveryId = {{partnerDelivery.response.body.$.data.content[0].id}}
@orderId = {{order.response.body.$.data.id}}


### 1. A new customer registers (public) -> 201 with a token; publishes UserRegistered
# @name register
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kavya Rao",
  "email": "kavya.{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "phone": "9{{$randomInt 100000000 999999999}}",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}


### 2. (wait) customer-service created the profile from UserRegistered
# @wait 3
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 3. Add a delivery address in Indiranagar (PIN 560038: Fresh Mart delivers there)
# @name address
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/customers/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "HOME",
  "contactName": "Kavya Rao",
  "contactPhone": "9845098450",
  "addressLine1": "21, 12th Main, HAL 2nd Stage",
  "landmark": "Near the metro station",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "state": "Karnataka",
  "pincode": "560038"
}


### 4. Browse: Dairy & Eggs (category 3), only products in stock (public)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products?categoryId=3&inStockOnly=true&sort=PRICE_LOW_TO_HIGH


### 5. Search "apple"
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=apple


### 6. Add 4 x Amul Taaza Toned Milk (4 x 27.00)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 6,
  "quantity": 4
}


### 7. Add 1 kg of Shimla apples (162.00)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 5,
  "quantity": 1
}


### 8. Add 2 kg of tomatoes (2 x 36.00) -> items total 342.00, free delivery
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}


### 9. Offers at Fresh Mart (public)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/coupons?storeId=1


### 10. Apply WELCOME50 (first order, 299 or more) -> payable 292.00
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/coupon
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME50"
}


### 11. Checkout page: today's prices, ready
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 12. Place the order, cash on delivery -> 201 PENDING
# @name order
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": {{addressId}},
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "note": "Leave it with the security guard if I am out"
}


### 13. (wait) Stock reserved + COD accepted -> CONFIRMED
# @wait 4
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 14. vendor1 (Fresh Mart) logs in
# @name vendorLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vendor1@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 15. The vendor got a "New order" notification
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 16. The vendor accepts the order
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/orders/{{orderId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 17. ...packs it
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/orders/{{orderId}}/pack
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 18. ...and hands it over
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/vendor/orders/{{orderId}}/ready-for-pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{vendorToken}}


### 19. delivery1 (Arjun Singh, user 5, zone Indiranagar) logs in
# @name partnerLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "delivery1@grocery.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}


### 20. (wait) delivery1 goes online -> delivery-service assigns the waiting delivery to them (DeliveryAssigned)
# @wait 3
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/availability/online
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 21. delivery1's current delivery: ASSIGNED, pickup at Fresh Mart, drop at the customer's address
# @name partnerDelivery
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/deliveries?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 22. delivery1 accepts it
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 23. ...collects it at the store (DeliveryPickedUp -> order OUT_FOR_DELIVERY)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/pick-up
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 24. (wait) The order is OUT_FOR_DELIVERY and shows deliveryPartnerName "Arjun Singh"
# @wait 3
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 25. ...starts the trip
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 26. ...and delivers it (DeliveryCompleted -> order DELIVERED, paymentStatus PAID: the cash was collected)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/delivery/deliveries/{{deliveryId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{partnerToken}}


### 27. (wait) The customer's tracking timeline: PENDING -> CONFIRMED -> ACCEPTED -> PACKED -> READY_FOR_PICKUP -> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY -> DELIVERED
# @wait 3
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 28. The customer's notifications: welcome, confirmed, accepted, packed, partner assigned, on the way, delivered
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### 29. The same messages arrived by email (Mailpit API; also visible at http://localhost:8025)
GET http://localhost:8025/api/v1/search?query=to:{{customerEmail}}


### 30. WELCOME50 is used now: applying it to a new cart says so
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 5,
  "quantity": 2
}


### 31. -> 400 "You have already used coupon WELCOME50"
PUT {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart/coupon
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME50"
}


### 32. CLEAN UP: empty the cart
DELETE {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
